s, and Pilot Pete, Adam Christianson, and Dave Hamilton are here to help you figure out what&#8217;s actually worth your money. You kick things off with the big question: what are your three favorite geeks gonna buy? They then dig into the reasons, starting with the Apple Watch Series 12 and Ultra 4: battery life, new health sensors, Live Rewind, Siri Recap, and an Audio Intelligence feature that really should&#8217;ve been called Audible Intelligence. Then it&#8217;s on to the star of the show, the iPhone Duo, where you get the real story on its price, how much storage you actually need, and that crease. And, oh yeah, MagSafe.</p>
